'''Lophiiformes Angaburu''' (超魚獣アンガブル, ''Chō Gyojū Angaburu'', '''Super Fish-Beast Angaburu''') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Henry]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]]. It was added in [[Version 12.5 Update|Version 12.5]].

