==Trivia==
*[[wikipedia:Lophiiformes|Lophiiformes]] is the taxonomic order of fish commonly known as anglerfishes.
*Lophiiformes Angaburu has many similarities to [[wikia:monsterhunter:Gobul|Gobul]] from ''Monster Hunter 3'', including its purple coloration, spikes, sharp, thin fangs, and the design of its lure. The name Angaburu is a portmanteau of ''anglerfish'' and ''Chanagaburu'' (Gobul's Japanese name).
*The line, "Heard a rumor that [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] don't have school nor exams," in its Japanese description could be a reference to the [https://youtu.be/vWTKaoi6UBE opening theme] of ''[[wikipedia:GeGeGe no Kitarō|GeGeGe no Kitarō]]'', which has a lyric saying the same thing about ''[[wikipedia:Yōkai|yōkai]]''.
*Lophiiformes Angaburu is implied to simply be [[Henry]] after dying of exhaustion, as Henry's Japanese description says he failed the university entrance exams 9 times, and this enemy died on its 10th.
*Lophiiformes Angaburu is the first [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] to have no immunities and the first Behemoth to have more than one trait.
*Lophiiformes Angaburu is tied with [[Johnnyleon]] and [[Prof. Owlbrowley]] for the most types of any non-event enemy, with three.
*Unlike most other Zombies, Angaburu's eyes have white sclerae with black pupils as opposed to the reverse, matching Henry's original appearance.

